# @hub-lanes

# ── PREQUEUE LEARNED (BH-6335) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The learned list for the pre-queue gate: one local record per FAILED
# merge-queue batch run of Harness CI, holding the tests/*.sh suites that
# failed in it. The conductor hook reads the frequent ones through --list.
# Twice an hour, off ci-batch-ledger's :11/:41; at most PAGES + MAX GitHub
# reads, skipped while the bucket is low. Kill: bin/harness-ctl.sh off prequeue-learned.
23,53 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/prequeue-learned.sh --refresh >/dev/null 2>&1
